### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz

### Set a key with TTL
POST http://localhost:8080/command/set
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "name",
  "value": "tiny",
  "ttlSeconds": 60
}

### Get a key
GET http://localhost:8080/command/get?key=name

### Read TTL
GET http://localhost:8080/command/ttl?key=name

### Update TTL
POST http://localhost:8080/command/expire
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "name",
  "ttlSeconds": 120
}

### Delete a key
DELETE http://localhost:8080/command/del?key=name

### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics

### Key metadata
GET http://localhost:8080/debug/keys

### LRU order
GET http://localhost:8080/debug/lru

### Recent events
GET http://localhost:8080/debug/events

### Live event stream
GET http://localhost:8080/debug/events/stream
